Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 22:44:31 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] process-data: Read msm counters and resolve platform DRM
 cards

Parse msm engine time in nanoseconds and total memory in KiB. Reuse the
existing process aggregation and elapsed-time accounting for GPU load.

Platform DRM fdinfo lacks drm-pdev. Resolve its primary card from the
open DRM node and sysfs, since render minor numbering is independent of
card numbering. Preserve PCI slot identification and reject unresolved
devices instead of silently attributing their counters to card0.

Exercise renderD128 mapped to card1, memory units and advancing counters
with a temporary sysfs/fdinfo fixture.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
